    m_Localized: SV 30
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102612
    m_Localized: "Ad\u0131n\u0131 30 g\xFCnde bir de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102613
    m_Localized: "S\u0130L"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102614
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n\u0131 silmek istiyor musun?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102615
    m_Localized: "\xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yapmak istiyor musun?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102616
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n 30 g\xFCn sonra kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Bu s\xFCre i\xE7inde giri\u015F yaparsan silme i\u015Flemi iptal olur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102617
    m_Localized: "\xC7iplerin, ilerlemen ve arkada\u015Flar\u0131n Google hesab\u0131nda saklan\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011Fin zaman tekrar giri\u015F yapabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102618
    m_Localized: "Onaylamak i\xE7in ${word} yaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102619
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131 sil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102620
    m_Localized: "\xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yap"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102621
    m_Localized: "Silme talebin al\u0131nd\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102622
    m_Localized: "\xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yap\u0131ld\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102623
    m_Localized: "30 g\xFCn i\xE7inde giri\u015F yaparak iptal edebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102624
    m_Localized: "Masada g\xF6r\xFC\u015Fmek \xFCzere."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102625
    m_Localized: Tamam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102626
    m_Localized: "Arkada\u015F kodu veya oyuncu ad\u0131yla ara"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102627
    m_Localized: "\xD6rn. MK-3321"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102628
    m_Localized: Ara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102629
    m_Localized: Kod ya da ad girip Ara'ya bas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102630
    m_Localized: "Bu oyuncuyla zaten arkada\u015Fs\u0131n\u0131z."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102631
    m_Localized: "Oyuncu bulunamad\u0131. Kodu kontrol edip tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102632
    m_Localized: "\u0130stek g\xF6nderildi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102633
    m_Localized: "\u0130stek g\xF6nder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102634
    m_Localized: "Kopyaland\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102635
    m_Localized: Kopyala
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102636
    m_Localized: "Di\u011Fer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102637
    m_Localized: "Profil kart\u0131n\u0131 arkada\u015Flar\u0131na g\xF6nder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102638
    m_Localized: Sezon 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102639
    m_Localized: EL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102640
    m_Localized: KAZANMA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102641
    m_Localized: "EN \u0130Y\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102642
    m_Localized: "Profil ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102643
    m_Localized: "\u015Eununla payla\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102644
    m_Localized: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131y\u0131 kopyala"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102645
    m_Localized: "${name} a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102646
    m_Localized: "Arkada\u015F\u0131n\u0131 davet et, \xE7ip kazan"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102647
    m_Localized: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131nla gelen arkada\u015F\u0131n ilk elini oynay\u0131nca ikiniz de 2.000 \xE7ip kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102648
    m_Localized: "'\xC7ip', 'Elmas', 'G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102649
    m_Localized: "'Haftal\u0131k', 'Sezon', 'Arkada\u015Flar'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102650
    m_Localized: "'Genel', 'Rozetler', 'Ma\xE7 ge\xE7mi\u015Fi'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102651
    m_Localized: "'Klasik', 'Alt\u0131n', 'Galaksi'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102652
    m_Localized: "'Klasik', 'Alt\u0131n', 'Galaksi'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102653
    m_Localized: "'125.400 \xE7ip ve 340 elmas', 'Seviye 24, Alt\u0131n II derecesi ve rozetler', 'Arkada\u015F listesi ve ma\xE7 ge\xE7mi\u015Fi'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102654
    m_Localized: "\xC7ip"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102655
    m_Localized: Elmas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102656
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102657
    m_Localized: "Haftal\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102658
    m_Localized: Sezon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102659
    m_Localized: Genel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102660
    m_Localized: Rozetler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102661
    m_Localized: "Ma\xE7 ge\xE7mi\u015Fi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102662
    m_Localized: Klasik
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102663
    m_Localized: "Alt\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102664
    m_Localized: Galaksi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102665
    m_Localized: "125.400 \xE7ip ve 340 elmas"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102666
    m_Localized: "Seviye 24, Alt\u0131n II derecesi ve rozetler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102667
    m_Localized: "Arkada\u015F listesi ve ma\xE7 ge\xE7mi\u015Fi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102668
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin hemen, kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Bu i\u015Flem geri al\u0131namaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102669
    m_Localized: "Sunucuya ula\u015F\u0131lamad\u0131, hesab\u0131n silinmedi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102670
    m_Localized: Hesap silinemedi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102671
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n silindi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102672
    m_Localized: "Verilerin kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. Diledi\u011Fin zaman yeni bir hesapla d\xF6nebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102673
    m_Localized: "Sunucuya ula\u015F\u0131lamad\u0131, profil kaydedilmedi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102674
    m_Localized: "Bu ad ya da durum mesaj\u0131 uygun de\u011Fil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102675
    m_Localized: "De\u011Fi\u015Fiklikler kaydedilemedi. Tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102676
    m_Localized: "Gezegenler hizalan\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102677
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015Flar diziliyor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102678
    m_Localized: "Masalar haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102679
    m_Localized: "Neredeyse haz\u0131r\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102680
    m_Localized: "Haz\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102681
    m_Localized: "\u0130pucu: G\xF6stergenin bir \xFCst\xFC okeydir ve her ta\u015F\u0131n yerine ge\xE7er."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102682
    m_Localized: "\u0130pucu: Elini a\xE7mak i\xE7in 101 puanl\u0131k per ya da 5 \xE7ift gerekir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102683
    m_Localized: "\u0130pucu: Bir pere bas\u0131l\u0131 tutarak toplu ta\u015F\u0131yabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102684
    m_Localized: "\u0130pucu: \u0130\u015Flek ta\u015F\u0131 atarsan +101 ceza yaz\u0131l\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102685
    m_Localized: "Masalar dolu, ta\u015Flar haz\u0131r.\nArkada\u015Flar\u0131nla otur, 101 a\xE7\u0131p eli bitir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102686
    m_Localized: "Ho\u015F geldin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102687
    m_Localized: "Nas\u0131l devam etmek istersin?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102688
    m_Localized: "M\u0130SAF\u0130R OLARAK OYNA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102689
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t yok \xB7 hemen ba\u015Fla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102690
    m_Localized: "Giri\u015F yap"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102691
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t ol"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102692
    m_Localized: ya da
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102693
    m_Localized: "Devam ederek Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015Fullar\u0131\u2019n\u0131 ve Gizlilik Politikas\u0131\u2019n\u0131 kabul etmi\u015F olursun. Oyun sanal \xE7iple oynan\u0131r; ger\xE7ek para kazand\u0131rmaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102694
    m_Localized: Google ile devam et
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102695
    m_Localized: "Google ile giri\u015F bu s\xFCr\xFCmde hen\xFCz a\xE7\u0131k de\u011Fil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102696
    m_Localized: Geri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102697
    m_Localized: Gizle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102698
    m_Localized: "G\xF6ster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102699
    m_Localized: "Zay\u0131f"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102700
    m_Localized: "G\xFC\xE7l\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102701
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131nla kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n yerden devam et"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102702
    m_Localized: ya da e-postayla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102703
    m_Localized: E-POSTA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102704
    m_Localized: "\u015E\u0130FRE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102705
    m_Localized: En az 6 karakter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102706
    m_Localized: "Beni hat\u0131rla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102707
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifremi unuttum"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102708
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n yok mu?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102709
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreni s\u0131f\u0131rla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102710
    m_Localized: "E-postana gelen 6 haneli kodu ve yeni \u015Fifreni yaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102711
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-postas\u0131n\u0131 yaz, s\u0131f\u0131rlama kodu g\xF6nderelim"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102712
    m_Localized: KOD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102713
    m_Localized: "YEN\u0130 \u015E\u0130FRE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102714
    m_Localized: "YEN\u0130 \u015E\u0130FRE (TEKRAR)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102715
    m_Localized: "Ayn\u0131 \u015Fifre"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102716
    m_Localized: "Kodu yeniden g\xF6nder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102717
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreyi de\u011Fi\u015Ftir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102718
    m_Localized: "Kod g\xF6nder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102719
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreni hat\u0131rlad\u0131n m\u0131?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102720
    m_Localized: "Hesap a\xE7, 25.000 \xE7ip hediye"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102721
    m_Localized: KULLANICI ADI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102722
    m_Localized: "3\u201316 karakter"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102723
    m_Localized: "Kullan\u0131labilir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102724
    m_Localized: "\u015E\u0130FRE TEKRAR"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102725
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreni tekrar yaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102726
    m_Localized: "Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015Fullar\u0131\u2019n\u0131 ve Gizlilik Politikas\u0131\u2019n\u0131 okudum, kabul ediyorum."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102727
    m_Localized: "Hesab\u0131 olu\u015Ftur"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102728
    m_Localized: "Zaten hesab\u0131n var m\u0131?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102729
    m_Localized: "Misafir giri\u015Fi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102730
    m_Localized: "\u0130lerlemen bu cihazda saklan\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102731
    m_Localized: TAKMA AD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102732
    m_Localized: "Masada g\xF6r\xFCnecek ad\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102733
    m_Localized: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7ta 10.000 \xE7ip hesab\u0131na y\xFCklenir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102734
    m_Localized: "Uygulamay\u0131 silersen ya da cihaz de\u011Fi\u015Ftirirsen ilerlemen kaybolur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102735
    m_Localized: "Oynamaya ba\u015Fla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102736
    m_Localized: "Sonra hesaba ba\u011Flayabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102737
    m_Localized: "Bir \u015Feyler ters gitti. Tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102738
    m_Localized: "Ge\xE7erli bir e-posta yaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102739
    m_Localized: "3\u201316 harf, rakam ya da _"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102740
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreler ayn\u0131 de\u011Fil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102741
    m_Localized: "Devam etmek i\xE7in ko\u015Fullar\u0131 kabul et"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102742
    m_Localized: 6 haneli kod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102743
    m_Localized: "Sunucu adresi g\xFCvenli de\u011Fil (https gerekli)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102744
    m_Localized: "Sunucuya ba\u011Flan\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternetini kontrol edip yeniden dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102745
    m_Localized: "Bu e-postayla kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesap bulunamad\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102746
    m_Localized: Bu e-postayla zaten hesap var
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102747
    m_Localized: "Bilgileri kontrol et: ad 3\u201316 karakter, \u015Fifre en az 6."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102748
    m_Localized: "\xC7ok h\u0131zl\u0131 denedin; biraz bekle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102749
    m_Localized: "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\xFCresi doldu. Yeni kod iste."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102750
    m_Localized: "\u015Eu an e-posta g\xF6nderilemiyor. Biraz sonra tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102751
    m_Localized: "Bu ad uygun de\u011Fil; ba\u015Fka bir ad se\xE7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102752
    m_Localized: TEST SENARYOSU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102753
    m_Localized: "Geli\u015Ftirici men\xFCs\xFC \xB7 F9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102754
    m_Localized: "\xC7evrimi\xE7i"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102755
    m_Localized: "T\xFCm\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102756
    m_Localized: "\u0130stekler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102757
    m_Localized: "\u0130zleme yak\u0131nda"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102758
    m_Localized: Oyuncu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102759
    m_Localized: "Masa a\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102760
    m_Localized: "Klasik \xB7 101 \xB7 masay\u0131 a\xE7\u0131nca otomatik oturursun"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102761
    m_Localized: Oyun modu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102762
    m_Localized: "Girdi\u011Fin moda g\xF6re; tip se\xE7ebilirsin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102763
    m_Localized: Tekli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102764
    m_Localized: "E\u015Fli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102765
    m_Localized: "Masa ad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102766
    m_Localized: "Masa ad\u0131 bo\u015F olamaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102767
    m_Localized: "Lobide ve davette g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102768
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 967102769
    m_Localized: "Lobide g\xF6r\xFCnmez, davet koduyla girilir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1802865266688
    m_Localized: Lobide listelenir, herkes oturabilir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4283099828224
    m_Localized: "A\xE7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864760156160
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985280
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifre"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985281
    m_Localized: 4 rakam gir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985282
    m_Localized: "Girenler bu \u015Fifreyi yazacak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985283
    m_Localized: "\u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 \xB7 4 haneli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985284
    m_Localized: "El say\u0131s\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985285
    m_Localized: "Ma\xE7 bu kadar el s\xFCrer, en d\xFC\u015F\xFCk toplam kazan\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985286
    m_Localized: Bahis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985287
    m_Localized: Yetersiz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985288
    m_Localized: Bakiyen yetersiz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985289
    m_Localized: "\xC7ip al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985290
    m_Localized: "\xD6d\xFCl"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985291
    m_Localized: "Kazanan tak\u0131m al\u0131r \xB7 ki\u015Fi ba\u015F\u0131 yar\u0131s\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985292
    m_Localized: "Kazanan al\u0131r \xB7 masadaki t\xFCm bahisler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985293
    m_Localized: Toplam havuz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985294
    m_Localized: "Katlamal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985295
    m_Localized: "Okeyle ya da \xE7iftle biti\u015Fte puanlar katlan\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985296
    m_Localized: "Tur s\xFCresi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985297
    m_Localized: "S\xFCre dolunca otomatik oynan\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985298
    m_Localized: 45 sn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985299
    m_Localized: "Kural \xF6zelle\u015Ftirme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985300
    m_Localized: "Varsay\u0131lan kurallar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985301
    m_Localized: "Okey atma cezas\u0131 (+101)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985302
    m_Localized: Okeyi yere atan +101 yazar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985303
    m_Localized: "\u0130\u015Flek ta\u015F atma cezas\u0131 (+101)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985304
    m_Localized: "Masadaki pere i\u015Flenebilen ta\u015F\u0131 atan +101 yazar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985305
    m_Localized: "\u0130zleyici"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985306
    m_Localized: "Oyun s\xFCrerken ba\u015Fkalar\u0131 izleyebilsin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985307
    m_Localized: "\u0130zin ver"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985308
    m_Localized: Verme
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985309
    m_Localized: Sohbet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985310
    m_Localized: "Masa i\xE7i yaz\u0131\u015Fma"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985311
    m_Localized: "A\xE7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985312
    m_Localized: "Yaln\u0131z haz\u0131r c\xFCmleler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985313
    m_Localized: "Kapal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985314
    m_Localized: "\u0130kram ve hediye"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985315
    m_Localized: "Oyuncular birbirine ikram g\xF6nderebilsin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985316
    m_Localized: "\xD6ZET"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985317
    m_Localized: "BAH\u0130S"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985318
    m_Localized: HAVUZ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985319
    m_Localized: "TUR S\xDCRES\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985320
    m_Localized: Bakiyen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985321
    m_Localized: Yetersiz bakiye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985322
    m_Localized: Eksikleri tamamla
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985323
    m_Localized: "Zaten bir masadas\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985324
    m_Localized: "Masan a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985325
    m_Localized: "Bot koltu\u011Fa oturdu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985326
    m_Localized: "Ayr\u0131l"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985327
    m_Localized: BEKLEME ODASI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985328
    m_Localized: Oda sahibi sensin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985329
    m_Localized: Kod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985330
    m_Localized: Kodu kopyala
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985331
    m_Localized: "Payla\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985332
    m_Localized: "Herkes yerinde, oyunu ba\u015Flat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985333
    m_Localized: "D\xF6rt koltuk dolunca ba\u015Flatabilirsin. Bo\u015F koltu\u011Fa bot ekleyebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985334
    m_Localized: "Oda sahibi oyunu ba\u015Flat\u0131nca masa a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985335
    m_Localized: "Ba\u015Flat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985336
    m_Localized: Oda sahibi bekleniyor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985337
    m_Localized: "Masa a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985338
    m_Localized: "Masa haz\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985339
    m_Localized: Oda sahibi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985340
    m_Localized: "Masadan \xE7\u0131kar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985341
    m_Localized: SEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985342
    m_Localized: "Tak\u0131m A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985343
    m_Localized: "Tak\u0131m B"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985344
    m_Localized: "Bo\u015F koltuk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985345
    m_Localized: Davet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985346
    m_Localized: Bot ekle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985347
    m_Localized: "Bekleme odas\u0131ndan ayr\u0131ld\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985348
    m_Localized: "Bot masadan \xE7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985349
    m_Localized: "D\xF6rt koltuk dolmadan ba\u015Flat\u0131lamaz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985350
    m_Localized: "Arkada\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131 davet et"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985351
    m_Localized: "Masa dolu \xB7 davet g\xF6nderilemez"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985352
    m_Localized: "Son oynad\u0131klar\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985353
    m_Localized: Oyuncu ara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985354
    m_Localized: "Hen\xFCz birlikte oynad\u0131\u011F\u0131n kimse yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985355
    m_Localized: "Hen\xFCz arkada\u015F\u0131n yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985356
    m_Localized: Bu isimde oyuncu yok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985357
    m_Localized: KOLTUKLAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985358
    m_Localized: KODLA DAVET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985359
    m_Localized: "A\xE7\u0131k masa lobide listelenir; davet edilen arkada\u015F\u0131n do\u011Frudan bo\u015F koltu\u011Fa oturur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985360
    m_Localized: "Kabul eden arkada\u015F\u0131n bo\u015F koltu\u011Fa otomatik oturur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985361
    m_Localized: Oyunda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985362
    m_Localized: Masada
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985363
    m_Localized: Masa dolu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985364
    m_Localized: Tekrar davet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985365
    m_Localized: Reddetti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985366
    m_Localized: "\u0130ptal etmek i\xE7in t\u0131kla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985367
    m_Localized: "Masaya ba\u011Flan\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985368
    m_Localized: Masa doldu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985369
    m_Localized: "Masa kapand\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985370
    m_Localized: "Son koltuk sen ba\u011Flan\u0131rken doldu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985371
    m_Localized: "Oda sahibi masay\u0131 kapatt\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985372
    m_Localized: Benzer masa bul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985373
    m_Localized: "Sunucuya ba\u011Flan\u0131lamad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985374
    m_Localized: "Lobi i\xE7in \xE7evrimi\xE7i olmal\u0131s\u0131n. Ba\u011Flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edip yeniden dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985375
    m_Localized: "Ana men\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985376
    m_Localized: Tekrar dene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985377
    m_Localized: Sonra
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985378
    m_Localized: "Kat\u0131l"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985379
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreli masa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985380
    m_Localized: Gir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985381
    m_Localized: "Kodla kat\u0131l"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985382
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel masalar lobide g\xF6r\xFCnmez; arkada\u015F\u0131ndan ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n kodu yaz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985383
    m_Localized: "Kod GX- ve 4 karakterden olu\u015Fur"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985384
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel masan haz\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985385
    m_Localized: "Masa lobide listelenmez. Kodu arkada\u015Flar\u0131na g\xF6nder, kodla kat\u0131ls\u0131nlar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985386
    m_Localized: DAVET KODU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985387
    m_Localized: "Davet metni kopyaland\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985388
    m_Localized: "Bekleme odas\u0131na ge\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985389
    m_Localized: "Odaya d\xF6n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985390
    m_Localized: "Oda sahibi seni masadan \xE7\u0131kard\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985391
    m_Localized: "Bakiyen yetmedi\u011Fi i\xE7in masadan kalkt\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985392
    m_Localized: "Masa kapand\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985393
    m_Localized: "Ba\u011Flant\u0131 koptu, masadan kalkt\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985394
    m_Localized: "Tekli ve e\u015Fli masalar \xB7 101 Okey"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985395
    m_Localized: "Masa a\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985396
    m_Localized: "Bo\u015F yer var"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985397
    m_Localized: Bekliyor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985398
    m_Localized: "Dolu \xB7 ba\u015Fl\u0131yor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985399
    m_Localized: Otur
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985400
    m_Localized: Dolu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985401
    m_Localized: "\u015Eifreli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985402
    m_Localized: "\xD72 Katlamal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985403
    m_Localized: "\u0130\u015Flek +101"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985404
    m_Localized: "\u0130zleyici a\xE7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985405
    m_Localized: "\u0130zleyici yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985406
    m_Localized: "Haz\u0131r sohbet"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985407
    m_Localized: "Sohbet kapal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985408
    m_Localized: "Hediye kapal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985409
    m_Localized: Bu filtrelere uygun masa yok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985410
    m_Localized: "Filtreleri temizle ya da kendi masan\u0131 a\xE7; a\xE7\u0131k masalar lobide hemen listelenir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985411
    m_Localized: Filtreleri temizle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985412
    m_Localized: Masa ara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985413
    m_Localized: "Yanl\u0131\u015F \u015Fifre. Tekrar dene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985414
    m_Localized: "Bu masada hen\xFCz oyun ba\u015Flamad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985415
    m_Localized: "Bu masa izleyiciye kapal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985416
    m_Localized: "Bu koda ait a\xE7\u0131k bir masa bulunamad\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985417
    m_Localized: "Bu masada oyun ba\u015Flad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985418
    m_Localized: "Bakiyen bu masa i\xE7in yetersiz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985419
    m_Localized: "\u015Eu an benzer bo\u015F masa yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985420
    m_Localized: "Dereceli i\xE7in giri\u015F yapmal\u0131s\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985421
    m_Localized: "Dereceli \xB7 Sezon "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985422
    m_Localized: "Masa a\xE7\u0131lamad\u0131. Yeniden deneyin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985423
    m_Localized: Dereceli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985424
    m_Localized: "Botlara kar\u015F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985425
    m_Localized: YAKINDA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985426
    m_Localized: "Dereceli \xB7 Solo / Duo / Squad"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985427
    m_Localized: "Botlara kar\u015F\u0131 \xB7 antrenman \xB7 bahis yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985428
    m_Localized: "Klasik \xB7 Tekli / E\u015Fli \xB7 masalar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985429
    m_Localized: "Botlara kar\u015F\u0131 yak\u0131nda a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985430
    m_Localized: "t\xFCm modlarda"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985431
    m_Localized: "En \xFCst lig"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985432
    m_Localized: "101 \xB7 bahissiz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985433
    m_Localized: "Zaten bir masadas\u0131n ya da s\u0131radas\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985434
    m_Localized: "Sunucuya ula\u015F\u0131lamad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985435
    m_Localized: "E\u015Fle\u015Fme ba\u015Flat\u0131lamad\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985436
    m_Localized: "DERECEL\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985437
    m_Localized: "Rakip aran\u0131yor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985438
    m_Localized: " \xB7 ligine yak\u0131n oyuncular"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985439
    m_Localized: ' sn'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985440
    m_Localized: Tam ekran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985441
    m_Localized: "\xC7er\xE7evesiz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985442
    m_Localized: Pencere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985443
    m_Localized: "G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFC modu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985444
    m_Localized: "Tam ekran, \xE7er\xE7evesiz pencere veya pencere"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985445
    m_Localized: "Yerel \xB7 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985446
    m_Localized: "Monit\xF6r en fazla "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985447
    m_Localized: "Kare h\u0131z\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985448
    m_Localized: "\u0130\u015Flem tamam"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985449
    m_Localized: Yetersiz elmas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985450
    m_Localized: "3D masa y\xFCkleniyor\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985451
    m_Localized: Tekli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985452
    m_Localized: "Tekli \xB7 101 \xB7 5K masa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985453
    m_Localized: "E\u015Fli \xB7 101 \xB7 5K masa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985454
    m_Localized: "Katlamal\u0131 \xB7 101 \xB7 10K masa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985455
    m_Localized: "Dereceli \xB7 Alt\u0131n II"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985456
    m_Localized: "Botlara kar\u015F\u0131 \xB7 antrenman"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985457
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel oda"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985458
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel oda \xB7 \u015Fifreli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985459
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015Flar ve okey"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985460
    m_Localized: "Oyunda 106 ta\u015F var: k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131, sar\u0131, mavi ve siyah renklerde 1'den 13'e kadar iki\u015Fer ta\u015F ve 2 sahte okey."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985461
    m_Localized: "Ortadan a\xE7\u0131lan ta\u015F g\xF6stergedir. G\xF6stergenin bir \xFCst\xFC okeydir ve her ta\u015F\u0131n yerine ge\xE7ebilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985462
    m_Localized: "Sahte okey, okeyin kendisi yerine kullan\u0131l\u0131r; de\u011Feri okeyin de\u011Feridir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985463
    m_Localized: "G\xF6sterge sar\u0131 7 ise okey sar\u0131 8 olur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985464
    m_Localized: "Da\u011F\u0131t\u0131m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985465
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015Flar kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r ve her oyuncuya 21 ta\u015F da\u011F\u0131t\u0131l\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985466
    m_Localized: "Oyunu ba\u015Flatan oyuncu 22 ta\u015F al\u0131r ve ilk hamlede bir ta\u015F atarak ba\u015Flar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985467
    m_Localized: "Kalan ta\u015Flar ortada \xE7ekme destesi olur. S\u0131ra saat y\xF6n\xFCn\xFCn tersine ilerler."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985468
    m_Localized: "Elini a\xE7mak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985469
    m_Localized: "Elini a\xE7abilmek i\xE7in perlerinin toplam\u0131 en az 101 olmal\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985470
    m_Localized: "Seri: ayn\u0131 renkte en az 3 ard\u0131\u015F\u0131k ta\u015F. Grup: ayn\u0131 say\u0131da, farkl\u0131 renklerde 3 veya 4 ta\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985471
    m_Localized: "\u0130stersen en az 5 \xE7iftle \xE7iftten de a\xE7abilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985472
    m_Localized: "Seri 46 + grup 36 = 82 puan. A\xE7mak i\xE7in 19 puan daha gerekir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985473
    m_Localized: "Ta\u015F i\u015Flemek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985474
    m_Localized: "Elini a\xE7t\u0131ktan sonra masadaki t\xFCm perlere uygun ta\u015F ekleyebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985475
    m_Localized: "Masadaki bir perde okeyin yerini tutan ta\u015F sende varsa, onu koyup okeyi alabilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985476
    m_Localized: "K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 13'\xFC masadaki k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 seriye i\u015Fleyebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985477
    m_Localized: Bitirmek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985478
    m_Localized: "Elindeki t\xFCm ta\u015Flar\u0131 perlere yerle\u015Ftirip son ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131 atan oyuncu eli bitirir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985479
    m_Localized: "Son ta\u015F olarak okeyi atarak bitirirsen b\xFCt\xFCn cezalar ikiye katlan\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985480
    m_Localized: "Son ta\u015F olarak okeyi atmak cezalar\u0131 ikiye katlar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985481
    m_Localized: Puanlama
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985482
    m_Localized: "Eli bitiren oyuncu -101 puan al\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985483
    m_Localized: "Elini a\xE7an oyuncular ellerinde kalan ta\u015Flar\u0131n toplam\u0131 kadar ceza al\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985484
    m_Localized: "Elini a\xE7amayan oyuncu 202 ceza al\u0131r. \xC7iftten a\xE7anlar\u0131n cezas\u0131 ikiye katlan\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985485
    m_Localized: "Oyun sonunda en d\xFC\u015F\xFCk puana sahip oyuncu kazan\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985486
    m_Localized: "G\xF6sterge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985487
    m_Localized: Okey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985488
    m_Localized: "\u0130\u015Fle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985489
    m_Localized: "Son ta\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985490
    m_Localized: Bronz III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1595864885985491
